WEBVTT

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:31.650
Get ready!

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.570
--Go, Shoot!

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.250
Go, Driger!

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:02.760
Cyber Driger!!

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.320
Byakko!!

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.550
Rei finally won his intense match against Salima, who was being controlled

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.970
by the power of
the digital Sacred Beast.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:26.220
Thanks to that, Salima was
able to return to her old self.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:30.020
And now, both sides are even
with one win and one loss.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.650
The real battles have yet to come.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.920
That was an excellent victory, Rei.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.170
I was moved!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:05.260
And now it's our turn, Kai.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:20.280
Freakin' Salima,
making us look bad.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:26.660
It appears to me that we may have been too
reliant on the power of the digital Sacred Beasts.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.990
Well, Doctor?

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:33.580
Mr. Gideon, we will obtain the
remaining two Sacred Beasts, without fail.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.960
I do not wish to hear
your empty promises!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:40.550
In actuality, we have
another trick up our sleeve.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.340
And?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.100
This is...

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.610
This is our ultimate trump card.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:01.900
Don't you agree, Mr. Gideon?

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.540
Welcome to the third stage, kids.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:18.210
Allow me to introduce your
opponent for the third battle.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.430
Goki! It's you and me!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.690
Hold on.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.690
I'll go.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.660
Counting on you, Kai!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:22.820
You've got guts if you
think you can take me on.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:31.240
I'm gonna smash your Bey
until there's nothing left of it!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:38.710
Kai!!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.840
Yuya...!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:53.600
Three! Two! One!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.890
Go, Shoot!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:07.570
Look at him go!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:11.410
Kai's going at full
throttle from the start...

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.080
--That's the way, Kai!
--Go, go!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:18.250
Yuya...
I will avenge you.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.210
Dranzer!!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.220
Finally found it.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:40.270
Like hell we're gonna
let you take Genbu!!

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.190
That musclehead!

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.690
Let's move.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.650
Will wonders ever cease?

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:48.940
Doctor!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.700
What's this?

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.200
Those little--!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.530
Don't lose track of them!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.590
Go! Cyber Dranzer!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.110
He's smiling.

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.360
He's just bluffin'.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.860
I'm not so sure of that.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:41.120
Despite being on the defense, he
doesn't appear to be bothered by it at all.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:44.080
Is that just it?
Or does he have a plan?

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:48.710
Is it because he's relying on the
growth of the digital Sacred Beast?

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.590
I get the feeling that's
not the whole story.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:54.630
You're such a worrywart, Kyoujyu.

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.890
That's the way! You can do it!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:09.020
That's the oldest
trick in the book!

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.150
Huh?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.740
Y-you gotta be kidding me!

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.910
It's grown this much already?!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.580
The real battle...

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.410
has just begun!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.670
Destroy him!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.800
Yuya...

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:02.620
Time to put our
trump card into play.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.620
Do it, Goki! Code Alpha!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.750
Go! Cyber Dranzer!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.510
--What the--?!
--That must be...!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.970
That's Draciel's attack pattern!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:24.850
What's going on?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:30.940
Draciel's data from Max and Jim's battle has been uploaded into Cyber Dranzer!

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.770
But how?!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.860
We've got plenty
of surprises left.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.650
Goki! Time for the next trump card!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.280
Code Beta!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.660
Cyber Dranzer!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.040
Now it's Driger's attack pattern!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:54.590
The data from Draciel's and Driger's battles have been uploaded to Cyber Dranzer!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.670
No way!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:59.970
Was he acting calm because
he had this up his sleeve?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.800
I can't believe they'd
steal your attacks!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.560
Who am I fighting against?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.350
Kai...

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:16.820
It's not your fault
I became like this...

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.690
No, you're wrong.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:22.780
If I was able to
save you, you'd be...

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.450
Kai!!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:30.080
Finish him off, Cyber Dranzer!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:42.970
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.730
Damn...

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.080
Impossible.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.550
It's not over yet!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.010
He blew his perfect chance...

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:27.970
Goddamn!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.850
What does that
moron think he's doing?

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:34.520
The third battle will continue.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.110
Do it over.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:44.860
Are you okay?

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:47.030
Yeah.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.790
What's up with you, Kai?

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:53.460
You're always acting so cool.
It's rare to see you lose it.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.460
He took some unexpected attacks.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.550
Even Kai couldn't see that coming.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.170
Battle with a clear
head, and you'll be fine.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:11.140
Yeah. You've got Draciel and Driger's
attack patterns memorized all up here.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:16.020
You should be able to counter
either pattern they throw at you!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.770
Now, now...

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:23.190
We don't need to worry.
The next match'll be fine!

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:24.030
Right?

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.530
His unexpected attacks...

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.870
aren't the only
reason I got thrown off.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.370
What do you mean?

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.010
He...

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:51.680
looks like Yuya.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:53.020
Yuya?

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.850
It's his facial expression.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.400
It's just like how
Yuya was back then.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:09.370
Run wild! Bite right into him! Digital Bird!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:18.670
So you can't get serious because you
feel like you're being attacked by Yuya?

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.630
I didn't say that.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.000
But that's what it is, right?

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:29.470
I didn't think you
could be such a softie.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.550
Come again?

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.180
Listen up, Kai.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.430
He's not Yuya,

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.480
and it's not your fault
he ended up like that.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.230
But...

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.520
I couldn't save Yuya!

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:43.770
--Kai...

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:46.740
But you're fighting now!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:51.200
You're fighting for Yuya!
Don't forget that!

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:57.500
Kai, are you all set
for the next battle?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.170
Kai... have you gotten
your emotions in check?

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.010
You made it out by
the skin of your teeth.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.980
You've got luck, I'll give you that.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:26.360
Three! Two! One!

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.320
Go, Shoot!!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:37.080
This time, I'll crush you
until there's nothing left!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.040
Kai...

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.920
Draciel-attack!

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.250
Keep it together, Kai!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.760
Go, Driger!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:53.090
Grind him into dust!!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:01.060
That's not Driger!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.860
Hey, Kyoujyu.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.360
I've been thinking.

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.780
What is it?

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.200
In a battle, aren't you
battling against yourself

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:18.040
as much as you
are your opponent?

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.500
What's with that, Takao?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.170
I agree, Takao.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:38.010
It's not like you to
stay on the defense.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:41.180
And you call yourself Kai Hiwatari?!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.020
Yuya...!

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:47.560
Kai's conflicted, isn't he?

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.650
Yeah.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:54.990
I'll make sure you never
recover, just like me!

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.000
You better not lose, Kai!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.800
I... I want to get stronger!

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.420
Just like you, Kai!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:22.770
Yuya...

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.820
It's on.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.000
That's the way, Kai!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.670
What a stubborn Blader...

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:52.590
I'm fighting for Yuya!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.590
I'm Yuya Minami.
Nice to meet you.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.230
I've always wanted to be
a strong Blader like you.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.560
You're my hero!

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:11.820
And now, I'll fight like Kai...

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.650
I'll fight for Kai!

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:19.200
I wanna see it.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.950
I want to see you battle with passion!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.830
Watch over me, Yuya.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:27.910
Watch over...

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.630
my battle!!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:35.460
Kai...

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.170
Kai yelled!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:39.680
I've never seen Kai like this.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.760
Dranzer!!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:50.600
Come on out! Cyber Dranzer!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.540
It grew again!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.050
Suzaku!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.800
I can't...

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:21.430
I can't lose!!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:30.690
I'm a Blader who can easily master a
Beyblade with or without a digital Sacred Beast!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:33.860
I'm in a different league
from that coward of a Blader

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:37.230
who got drunk off the
charm of the digital Sacred Beast!

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:42.570
No... no... no...

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:45.990
I don't want to fight anymore. I can't fight.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.710
You made fun of him...

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:04.340
You made fun of Yuya!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:28.160
Yuya is no coward!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:31.040
Go, Dranzer!!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.270
He won!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:55.020
--He did it!
--You did it, Kai!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:58.440
Kai won the battle
against himself, right Takao?

00:20:58.860 --> 00:20:59.900
Yeah!

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.410
Yuya...

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.120
I've avenged you.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:12.580
Kai...

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.210
Thank you.

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:03.190
Our fights in the Battle Tower
are about to reach an end--

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:06.280
But Chairman Daitenji has gone missing ever since we entered the tower!

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:08.570
Can you spare a Chairman
somewhere in this lair?

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:11.320
I've got so many chills
it could kill with skill!

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:14.120
But more importantly, it's time
for Takao and Kane's battle!

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:17.410
It's going to be one of
the biggest clashes so far!

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:20.330
You won't want to
miss the next episode!
